<title>JAPAN: Argentina may launch samurais on Thursday - sources.</title>
<headline>Argentina may launch samurais on Thursday - sources.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina may launch two tranches of samurai bonds with maturities of six- and 10-years on Thursday, depending on the market conditions, underwriting sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The issues will be lead-managed by Nikko Securities.</p>
<p>Underwriters said the scale of the offer was unknown.</p>
</text>
